// oink demo story

The old bridge creaks under your boots. On the far side, a troll
sharpens a rusty cleaver, eyeing you with mild professional interest.

*   [Fight the troll]
    You draw your sword and charge. -> fight
*   [Try to talk]
    "Nice cleaver," you offer. -> talk
*   [Turn back]
    Discretion wins. You walk away, mission unaccomplished. -> END

=== fight ===
Steel rings against steel. The troll is strong, but slow.
*   [Press the attack]
    You slip under its guard and win the day! -> victory
*   [Retreat]
    You back off the bridge, bruised but alive. -> END

=== talk ===
The troll blinks. Nobody has complimented its cleaver in two hundred years.
It waves you across, almost shyly.
-> victory

=== victory ===
You cross the bridge. The road to adventure lies open before you.
-> END
